Z||000000||mrgone||06-09-2001||03:05 AM||||does your car have to be stopped almost completly to be put into first gear?<P>my 86 2m4 5 speed does and it makes right hand turns annoying when i want power<P>or is there somthing wrong||||reg||13
Z||000001||Uaana||06-09-2001||03:47 AM||||Think it really depends on what tranny you have. With the 4spd in my 85 1st is a formality. good for smoke shows and pulling semi's. Now the 4 in my 86 I can drop down into first around 15mph. But as a general rule most are really really low and I think the syncros are not set up for quick drops into first. I'm sure someone with more tech specs will give you a more detailed reason. but I'm bored and need more posts.. Someday I'll hit 500||||reg||1
Z||000002||johnt671||06-09-2001||07:35 AM||||My 84 2M4 has to be below 15 also or it will not let me hit first gear.||||reg||1
Z||000003||PBJ||06-09-2001||09:51 AM||||You gotta love GM's 80's technology.  Pretty much normal.  This kind of transmission "problem"  I think is what really helped the 80's rice to take off. You just cant compare the two for shift easy and feel, but then again they aren't dealing with torque like USA cars do.  Ever try driving a chry. K car stick.||||reg||1
Z||000004||thomas_l||06-09-2001||10:04 AM||||Possibly worn synchros or worse, low trans lube. When I was autocrossing I was doing 2-1 shifts with just moderately higher than normal force on the shifter and no grinding. Normal driving, the 2-1 downshift is smooth.||||reg||1
Z||000005||mrgone||06-09-2001||12:37 PM||||thomas_I what tranny you have?||||reg||1
Z||000006||Scott||06-10-2001||04:04 PM||||Hi mrgone,<BR>  I had the same problem w/ my '85 2M4.  But after the following changes it got much, much better.  This is what I did:  new bushings on the transmition end of the shift linkage, lubed the shifter mech. up front (w/ teflon to avoid dust collection), adjusted the shift cables, drained the ATF from the tranny and replaced it w/ Mobil-1 20w50.  This worked for me.  Good luck.<BR>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000007||thomas_l||06-11-2001||09:08 AM||||I have a 4 speed out of an 86 V6.||||reg||1
